title: Open containers cannot be reachable, except on a weird vehicle.
pid: 2ef0a0df-b780-4fc2-9b0e-5403a41cbe4a
body: |2-
  - If it is open, you must keep the container in the trunk or place where passengers do not sit.
  - This law does not apply if you are a passenger in a bus, taxi, camper, or motorhome.
